        {
          "id": "ak",
          "src": "images/assets/char/k10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "それは悪いことじゃないですね"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "彩愛",
      "text": "ふふ。そうですわね",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "ak",
          "src": "images/assets/char/k10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "彩愛さんは、チーズを一切れつまむ。"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "彩愛",
      "text": "そんなことまで話してしまうのは、少し困りますわ",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "ak",
          "src": "images/assets/char/k10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "どうしてですか？"
