        {
          "id": "ak",
          "src": "images/assets/char/k10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "その声は、冗談のようで。\nでも、少しだけ本音のようでもあった。"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "普通の彩愛さんも、素敵だと思います"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "彩愛",
      "text": "……",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "ak",
          "src": "images/assets/char/k10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "あ、すみません"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "彩愛",
      "text": "店長",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "ak",
          "src": "images/assets/char/k10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "はい"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "彩愛",
      "text": "今のは、謝るところではありません",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "ak",
          "src": "images/assets/char/k10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "……はい"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "彩愛",
      "text": "けれど、すぐに返事をするところでもありません",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "ak",
          "src": "images/assets/char/k10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "難しいですね"
